Package: LearnTidyML
Title: Machine Learning Method Assistant
Version: 0.3.2
Authors@R: person("Jason", "Geslois", email = "jason592470@duck.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Interactive 'shiny' app to help users select appropriate machine
    learning methods based on their data characteristics, using the 'tidymodels'
    framework. Provides data profiling, method recommendations, data cleaning,
    model training with comparison, and plain-English result explanations
    designed for educational use.
